      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING RAPUNZEL (2) doesn't win out of turn. Finished in the minors latest when third (31.12) at this track and may be close to breaking through. Has a good record at this journey. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings six times from eight starts. Likely to feature again. ZINFANDEL NOAH (8) finished fifth last time but the start prior broke the clock when winning over 400m at Gawler, taking a Grade 6 in a dynamic 22.56. Must include on winning run two back. SPEED RAIDER (1) turned in a plain performance last time when fifth at this track over 530m behind Attica Blue (31.39) in a Special conditions race. Placed at his previous run. Should play a prominent role. CANYA KATSU (4) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
